<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Continental starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Continental starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston analyst Thomas Schreier on Tuesday started coverage of Continental Airlines Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1/4 to 29 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
